<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Times+New+Roman:wght@400;700&display=swap');

        body {
            font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
            margin: 40px auto;
            max-width: 800px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #000;
            background: #fff;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 24pt;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 12pt;
            margin: 12px 0;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .title {
            font-size: 18pt;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 14pt;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .section-header {
            font-size: 13pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 25px 0 8px;
        }

        ul, ol {
            margin: 10px 0;
            padding-left: 30px;
        }

        li {
            margin: 6px 0;
        }

        .placeholder {
            width: 100%;
            height: 180px;
            background: #f8f8f8;
            border: 2px solid #ccc;
            margin: 20px 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 14pt;
            color: #666;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .chart-caption {
            font-size: 11pt;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 8px;
            color: #444;
        }

        .centered {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .right {
            text-align: right;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>TITLE</h1>

    <p class="centered">AUTHOR</p>
    <p class="centered">DATE</p>

    <div class="placeholder">[Chart: centered]</div>
    <p class="chart-caption">FIGURE 1: Main Chart</p>

    <p>This is the main paragraph of the document that discusses the primary topic and includes important details about the subject matter.</p>

    <div class="section-header">1. INTRODUCTION</div>

    <p>In the introduction section, the document begins by outlining the purpose and scope of the study or report. It sets the stage for the detailed analysis that follows.</p>

    <div class="section-header">2. BACKGROUND</div>

    <p>The background section provides essential context, including historical information and previous research findings that are relevant to the current work.</p>

    <div class="section-header">3. METHODS</div>

    <p>The methods section describes the experimental design, data collection procedures, and analytical techniques used in the study.</p>

    <div class="section-header">4. RESULTS</div>

    <p>The results section presents the key findings from the analysis, including statistical data and observations.</p>

    <div class="placeholder">[Chart: right-aligned]</div>
    <p class="chart-caption">FIGURE 2: Results Chart</p>

    <div class="section-header">5. DISCUSSION</div>

    <p>The discussion interprets the results and places them in the context of existing literature, highlighting implications and limitations.</p>

    <div class="section-header">6. CONCLUSION</div>

    <p>The conclusion summarizes the main outcomes and suggests directions for future research.</p>

    <p class="right">REFERENCES</p>

    <ol>
        <li>Reference one with full citation details.</li>
        <li>Reference two with additional supporting information.</li>
    </ol>
</body>
</html>
